##* {{RQ:Guardian|author=w:Marina Hyde|title=Anna Wintour has spent decades dictating a certain look for the super-rich. Then along came Lauren|date=2025-06-27|url=https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2025/jun/27/anna-wintour-super-rich-lauren-sanchez-jeff-bezos-vogue|passage=Here she is, a billionaire’s wife, yet gripped by constant social anxiety, forever agonising that she’d worn her best '''rocks''' to an event that actually called for “patio jewellery” (necklaces $1m or under).|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20261025183114/https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2025/jun/27/anna-wintour-super-rich-lauren-sanchez-jeff-bezos-vogue|archivedate=25 October 2026}}
